{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17119","headline":"劒化爲龙 · 张聿","name":"劒化爲龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古劒诚难屈，精明有所从。\n沈埋方出狱，合会却成龙。\n牛斗光初歇，蜿蜒气渐浓。\n云涛透百丈，水府跃千重。\n拖尾迷莲锷，张鳞露锦容。\n至今沙岸下，谁得覩玄踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张聿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}